|passage=Without a '''freeze''' it might be possible to proceed with the production and deployment of such destabilizing systems as the MX, Trident II, cruise missiles and SS-18s, -19s and -20s.}}
#* '''1983''' October 3, {{w|Ted Kennedy}}, speech, ''[[s:Truth and Tolerance in America|Truth and Tolerance in America]]'',
