===Etymology===
{{etymon|en|:inh|enm:frost|tree=+}}
From {{inh|en|enm|frost}}, from an unmetathesized variant of {{inh|en|ang|forst||frost}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*frustaz||frost}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*prews-|t=to freeze; frost}}. 

Cognate with {{cog|stq|Froast}}, {{m|stq|Fröäst||frost}}, {{cog|fy|froast||frost}}, {{cog|cim|bròst}}, {{m|cim|vrost}}, {{m|cim|vròst||frost}}, {{cog|nl|vorst||frost}}, {{cog|de|Frost||frost}}, {{cog|lb|Frascht||frost}}, {{cog|wym|fröst||frost}}, {{cog|da|-}}, {{cog|fo|-}}, {{cog|is|-}}, {{cog|nb|-}}, {{cog|nn|-}}, {{cog|sv|frost||frost}}, {{cog|la|pruīna||hoarfrost, frost, rime, snow}}. Related to {{l|en|freeze}}.

