{{etymon|en|:inh|enm:furre<ety:bor<xno:fuerre<id:sheath>>>|tree=1}}
From {{inh|en|enm|furre,forre}}, from {{der|en|xno|forre,fuerre||case; sheath}}, from {{der|en|frk|*fōdar}}, from {{der|en|gmw-pro|*fōdr}}, from {{der|en|gem-pro|*fōdrą|t=sheath}} (compare {{cog|ang|fōdor|t=sheaf}}, {{cog|nl|voering|t=lining}}, {{cog|de|Futter|t=lining}}, {{cog|got|𐍆𐍉𐌳𐍂|t=sheath}}), from {{der|en|ine-pro|*peh₂-}}, {{m|ine-pro|*poh₂-|t=to protect}} (compare {{cog|lt|piemuō|t=protection}}, {{cog|grc|πῶῠ̈|t=flock}}, {{m|grc|πῶμα|t=lid}}, {{m|grc|ποιμήν|t=shepherd}}, {{cog|xcl|հօրան|հաւրան|t=herd, flock}}, {{cog|kmr|pawan|t=to watch over}}, {{cog|sa|पाति|t=he watches, protects}}.

The verb is from {{inh|en|enm|furren}}, from {{der|en|xno|furrer}}, {{m|fro|forrer}}, {{m|fro|fourrer|t=to line, stuff, fill}}, from the noun.

