## {{lb|en|uncountable}} A thick [[pile]] of [[fabric]].
## {{lb|en|uncountable}} The soft, downy covering on the skin of a peach.
## {{lb|en|uncountable}} The deposit formed on the interior of boilers and other vessels by hard water.
## {{lb|en|uncountable}} The layer of [[epithelial]] [[debris]] on a [[tongue]].
# {{senseid|en|heraldry}} {{lb|en|heraldry|countable}} One of several [[pattern]]s or [[diaper#English:_decoration with repeating patterns|diaper]]s used as [[tincture#English:_heraldry|tincture]]s, such as [[ermine]] and [[vair]].
